<title>USA: Pride offers $300 mln notes, 5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Pride offers $300 mln notes, 5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pride Petroleum Services Inc said Wednesday that it will offer $300 million principal amount of senior notes due 2007 and five million common shares.</p>
<p>The company said underwriters in the stock offering will also be granted an over-allotment option to buy an additional 750,000 common shares.</p>
<p>Pride said it will use proceeds to refurbish two rigs, to repay outstanding indebtedness and for general corporate purposes.</p>
